                "text": "This #WorldCancerDay, I\u2019m thinking of my dad who passed away from pancreatic cancer and all the patients and families facing this terrible disease. I\u2019m committed to doing whatever I can and working with anyone I can to support the tools and research we need to finally beat it.",
