                "text": "It\u2019s an honor to receive the Congressional Advocacy Award from @MyotonicStrong. Their work in helping patients and families navigate myotonic dystrophy is critical, and I will always support federal efforts to accelerate research on treatments and cures. https://t.co/dnvHJBzjWv",
