                "text": "Dr. Neil Galindez began his career as a paramedic in Texas before becoming a cardiothoracic surgeon here in South Florida. For more than a decade, he\u2019s cared for patients in our community and shown what service and perseverance look like in action. https://t.co/VP0NtTglJA",
